    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.09_minimal_category_theory.chapters.01_objects_and_arrows.sections.04_concrete_anchor_survey.concrete_anchor_8_MctApex#mctapex" .
silm:instances_papers_09_minimal_category_theory_chapters_01_objects_and_arrows_sections_04_concrete_anchor_survey_concrete_anchor_8_MctApex#mctapex silm:hasLongDescription "The MctApex is the colimit apex colim D_Mittens, isomorphic to Mittens by the colimit anchor. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'MctApex', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
